  (text "THIET KE THEO TI INA163 (SBOS177D) Figure 5 trang 8 - Phantom-Powered Microphone Preamplifier."
    (at 20.32 236.22 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c362c2a0-d3d6-4abf-984c-74fc986d2cd4")
  )
  (text "Gain G = 1 + 6000/RG; RG = 60.4R -> G = 100.3 (40.0 dB). Doi R8/R18 de doi gain (bang RG trang 6)."
    (at 20.32 241.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "65f543c5-9a14-4fc5-abc4-8663d691125e")
  )
  (text "Moi chan phantom = 2 x 3.40k 0.1% 1206 noi tiep (6.80k, khop 0.1% cho CMRR). Khi chan mic chap GND: 0.34W chia 2 = 0.17W/con (dinh muc 0.25W)."
    (at 20.32 246.38 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e2d744ab-0355-48f6-83b7-071dc3260d09")
  )
  (text "C1/C2 khong phan cuc: datasheet note (1) - bat buoc khi co the tat phantom."
    (at 20.32 251.46 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "21b8e653-3ec9-43d8-808c-b8b4af31d684")
  )
  (text "D1/D2 BAV99 kep ve +/-15V (datasheet goi y 4x 1N4148). R6/R7 10R thin film: chia dong voi diode kep noi cua INA163 (abs max 10mA); nhieu them 0.57 nV/rtHz (2x10R) so voi 1 nV/rtHz cua IC."
    (at 20.32 256.54 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "9f664b91-0140-4d73-bfdf-29daa9b5d667")
  )
  (text "JP1/JP2: ON = noi 1-2 (+48V), OFF = noi 2-3 (xa tu qua 47k xuong GND, nhu R3 trong Fig.5). Header 2.54mm cung dung de noi cong tac mat may."
    (at 20.32 261.62 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4df7117d-bb6a-4d8f-9cdf-9492e6f477e8")
  )
  (text "XLR NC3FAH1: chan 1 = GND, vo connector noi chan 1 ben trong (theo mo ta Neutrik). Chan 2 = nong (+), chan 3 = nguoi (-)."
    (at 20.32 266.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "be80a2f8-71d4-44bc-b868-4f1426bdf6d5")
  )
  (text "D21/D22 SMAJ16A: kep rail +/-15V khi cam/rut mic luc dang bat P48 (tu 47u nap 48V xa qua BAV99 vao rail). Khong co trong datasheet - them theo kinh nghiem thiet ke."
    (at 20.32 271.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3b343dad-0c4b-4efb-97ca-6e0c918b18ad")
  )
  (text "Ngo ra DC-coupled (khong lap servo OPA134 cua Fig.5): offset xau nhat ~0.25V o G=100 -> tang sau phai AC-couple."
    (at 20.32 276.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e5605089-05d7-4b27-b240-9b6fd521d9d3")
  )
